     1	# ROADMAP
     2	
     3	- [What This Is](#what-this-is)
     4	- [Current Priority: Package Layering Refactor](#current-priority-package-layering-refactor)
     5	- [Architecture Direction](#architecture-direction)
     6	- [Multi-Harness Support (Exploratory)](#multi-harness-support-exploratory)
